<td width="64%" class="vd">
<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 01 &bull; Top Artificial Intelligence Cheat Sheet &amp; Deep Learning Mind Map</div>
<div class="sec-title">Artificial Intelligence Roadmap &amp; Cheat Sheet</div>
<div class="sec-desc">Structural breakdown of AI subfields: ML, Neural Networks, Deep Learning, Generative AI, @@MLOps@@, Autonomous Agents, Edge Computing, Continual Learning, and Multi-Tier Memory.</div>
</td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">NODES</div><div class="sec-val">33</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN C</div><div class="sec-val">86.2</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN Y</div><div class="sec-val">80.5</div></td>
</tr>
</table>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-autonomous-agents" name="node-autonomous-agents"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#001/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">autonomous-agents</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Autonomous AI &amp; Multi-Agent Systems</div><div class="ndesc">Self-directed software entities that perceive dynamic environments, formulate multi-step plans, execute external tool invocations, and reflect on intermediate feedback loops to achieve long-horizon goals.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P(\tau) = P(s_0) \prod_{t=0}^{T-1} \pi_\theta(a_t \mid s_t, h_t) P(s_{t+1} \mid s_t, a_t)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> ReAct Loop &bull; Grounding</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-causal-ai" name="node-causal-ai"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#002/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">causal-ai</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:100</td><td class="yld vd">Y:76</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Causal AI &amp; Decision Intelligence</div><div class="ndesc">Moving beyond associative correlation to model genuine cause-and-effect mechanics using Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs), structural equation modeling, and Pearl do-@@calculus@@.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P(Y \mid \text{do}(X=x)) = \sum_z P(Y \mid X=x, Z=z) P(Z=z)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Confounder &bull; Collider</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-automl-nas" name="node-automl-nas"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#003/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">automl-nas</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">AutoML &amp; Neural Architecture Search (NAS)</div><div class="ndesc">Algorithmic automation of machine learning model development pipelines, including hyperparameter tuning, feature engineering, and gradient-based neural architecture search.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\bar{o}^{(i,j)}(x) = \sum_{o \in \mathcal{O}} \frac{\exp(\alpha_o^{(i,j)})}{\sum_{o&#39; \in \mathcal{O}} \exp(\alpha_{o&#39;}^{(i,j)})} o(x)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Bi-Level Optimization &bull; Weight Sharing</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-mlops-lifecycle" name="node-mlops-lifecycle"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#004/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">mlops-lifecycle</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:61</td><td class="yld vd">Y:60</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">MLOps, CI/CD &amp; Feature Store Orchestration</div><div class="ndesc">Systematic discipline uniting machine learning system development and operations to standardize continuous integration, automated testing, model registry versioning, and drift monitoring.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\text{PSI} = \sum_{k=1}^K (P_k - Q_k) \times \ln\left( \frac{P_k}{Q_k} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Concept Drift &bull; Data Drift (Covariate Shift)</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-embedded-edge-ai" name="node-embedded-edge-ai"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#005/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">embedded-edge-ai</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Embedded AI, TinyML &amp; Edge Acceleration</div><div class="ndesc">Compressing and optimizing neural network topologies to execute on microcontrollers, edge TPUs, IoT devices, and autonomous robotics with strict milliwatt energy and kilobyte memory budgets.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">q = \text{clamp}\left( \left\lfloor \frac{x}{S} \right\rceil + Z, -128, 127 \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Operator Fusion &bull; Static Quantization</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-cybersecurity-ai" name="node-cybersecurity-ai"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#006/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">cybersecurity-ai</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Cybersecurity in AI: Infrastructure &amp; Data Defense</div><div class="ndesc">Holistic security envelope protecting machine learning assets: defending against adversarial perturbations, model inversion attacks, prompt injections, data poisoning, and infrastructure zero-days.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">x_{\text{adv}} = x + \epsilon \cdot \text{sign}\left( \nabla_x \mathcal{L}(\theta, x, y) \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Prompt Injection &bull; Model Inversion</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-iot-robotics" name="node-iot-robotics"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#007/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">iot-robotics</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:61</td><td class="yld vd">Y:60</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">IoT, Sensors &amp; Autonomous Robotics Systems</div><div class="ndesc">Integrating multispectral sensors, LiDAR point clouds, inertial measurement units (IMUs), and camera feeds through real-time state estimation and control theory for autonomous navigation.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">K_t = \Sigma_t H_t^T \left( H_t \Sigma_t H_t^T + R_t \right)^{-1}, \quad \mu_t = \mu_t^- + K_t \left( z_t - h(\mu_t^-) \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> SLAM &bull; Sensor Fusion</div></div></div>
