<td width="64%" class="vd">
<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 02 &bull; Dimensions of LLMs Architecture Taxonomy</div>
<div class="sec-title">Dimensions &amp; Architecture of Large Language Models</div>
<div class="sec-desc">Pre-training pipelines, multimodal projectors, alignment (RLHF, DPO), parameter-efficient fine-tuning (LoRA), quantization, pruning, reasoning, test-time compute scaling, and evaluation.</div>
</td>
