<div class="ncard"><a id="node-llm-pretraining" name="node-llm-pretraining"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#034/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">llm-pretraining</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">LLM Pre-Training: Single-Modal &amp; Multi-Modal Foundation</div><div class="ndesc">Self-supervised pre-training on trillion-token web datasets. Covers decoder-only architectures (GPT-3, LLaMA, PaLM) and multimodal vision-language projectors (Gemini, GPT-4, PaLM-E, MiniGPT-4).</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\mathcal{L}_{\text{LM}}(\theta) = - \sum_{i=1}^T \log P_\theta(x_i \mid x_1, x_2, \dots, x_{i-1})</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Decoder-Only &bull; Modality Projector</div></div></div>
