<div class="ncard"><a id="node-peft-lora" name="node-peft-lora"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#036/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">peft-lora</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:61</td><td class="yld vd">Y:60</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">PEFT: LoRA, QLoRA, Prefix &amp; Prompt Tuning</div><div class="ndesc">Techniques enabling adaptation of multi-billion parameter foundation models by freezing base weights and training minimal auxiliary parameters (&lt;1% of total parameter budget).</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">h = W_0 x + \Delta W x = W_0 x + \frac{\alpha}{r} (B A) x</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> LoRA &bull; QLoRA</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-llm-quantization" name="node-llm-quantization"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#037/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">llm-quantization</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Model Quantization: PTQ, QAT, AWQ &amp; GPTQ</div><div class="ndesc">Compressing high-precision FP16 model @@tensors@@ into INT8, INT4, FP8, or 2-bit representations to dramatically reduce memory footprint and increase memory-bandwidth @@throughput@@ during @@inference@@.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">W^* = \arg\min_W \| W X - Q(W \cdot S) S^{-1} X \|_F^2</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> PTQ &bull; QAT</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-efficient-transformers" name="node-efficient-transformers"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#038/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">efficient-transformers</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Efficient Architectures: Attention &amp; KV-Cache Optimizations</div><div class="ndesc">Breakthrough architectural enhancements overcoming the quadratic memory complexity of self-attention: FlashAttention IO-awareness, PagedAttention KV-cache management, MQA/GQA, and Speculative Decoding.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\text{Attention}(Q, K, V) = \text{softmax}\left( \frac{Q K^T}{\sqrt{d_k}} + M \right) V</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> FlashAttention &bull; PagedAttention</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-llm-reasoning" name="node-llm-reasoning"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#039/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">llm-reasoning</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:61</td><td class="yld vd">Y:60</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Inference Paradigms: Chain-of-Thought &amp; Tree-of-Thoughts</div><div class="ndesc">Eliciting complex algorithmic reasoning from frozen foundation models via verbalized intermediate thoughts, search tree exploration (ToT), self-consistency sampling, and test-time compute scaling.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P(y \mid x) = \sum_{z} P(y \mid x, z) P(z \mid x)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Chain-of-Thought (CoT) &bull; Tree-of-Thoughts (ToT)</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-llm-safety-eval" name="node-llm-safety-eval"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#040/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">llm-safety-eval</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:61</td><td class="yld vd">Y:60</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Evaluation: NLU, NLG, Safety, Bias &amp; Alignment Tax</div><div class="ndesc">Systematic frameworks measuring foundation model capabilities: Natural Language Understanding (NLU), Natural Language Generation (NLG), safety robustness, toxicity, memorization, and @@inference@@ electricity costs.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\text{PPL}(X) = \exp\left( - \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^N \log P_\theta(x_i \mid x_{&lt;i}) \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> MMLU &bull; Toxicity Benchmark</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-llm-applications" name="node-llm-applications"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#041/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">llm-applications</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:41</td><td class="yld vd">Y:52</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Domain Applications: Code, Medicine, Law &amp; Science</div><div class="ndesc">Customizing foundation models for high-stakes vertical domains: automated software engineering (Copilot), clinical decision support (Med-PaLM), legal document analysis, and symbolic mathematics.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\text{Pass}@k = \mathbb{E} \left[ 1 - \frac{\binom{n - c}{k}}{\binom{n}{k}} \right]</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> RAG &bull; Grammar-Constrained Decoding</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-large-reasoning-models-inference-scaling" name="node-large-reasoning-models-inference-scaling"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#042/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">large-reasoning-models-inference-scaling</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:100</td><td class="yld vd">Y:76</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Large Reasoning Models (LRMs) &amp; Test-Time Compute Scaling</div><div class="ndesc">@@Inference@@-time search algorithms and verifiers that deliver super-linear reasoning gains without parameter expansion by scaling test-time compute through Monte Carlo rollouts, step-level verification, and policy self-correction.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\mathcal{E}(N_{\text{test}}) = \alpha \cdot N_{\text{test}}^{-\beta_{\text{search}}} + \mathcal{E}_\infty</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Process Reward Model (PRM) &bull; Outcome Reward Model (ORM)</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-speculative-decoding-inference-economics" name="node-speculative-decoding-inference-economics"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#043/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">speculative-decoding-inference-economics</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Speculative Decoding &amp; Draft-Model Inference Economics</div><div class="ndesc">Accelerating autoregressive token generation by generating multi-token candidate drafts with a compact, ultra-fast draft model, subsequently verifying all candidates in parallel in a single forward pass of the larger target model.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\alpha = \mathbb{E}_{x \sim q} \left[ \min\left(1, \frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\right) \right]</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Speculative Decoding &bull; Draft Model</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-flashattention-io-aware-gpu-memory" name="node-flashattention-io-aware-gpu-memory"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#044/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">flashattention-io-aware-gpu-memory</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:100</td><td class="yld vd">Y:76</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">IO-Aware FlashAttention &amp; SRAM Memory Bandwidth Optimization</div><div class="ndesc">Hardware-aware exact attention @@algorithm@@ scaling linearly with context length by tiling computation to maximize fast on-chip SRAM usage and minimize slow high-bandwidth memory (HBM) memory access transactions.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\text{HBM Memory Accesses} = \mathcal{O}\left( \frac{N^2 d^2}{M} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> FlashAttention &bull; SRAM (Static Random-Access Memory)</div></div></div>
