<div class="ncard"><a id="node-mixture-of-experts-routing-capacity" name="node-mixture-of-experts-routing-capacity"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#046/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">mixture-of-experts-routing-capacity</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:100</td><td class="yld vd">Y:76</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Mixture of Experts (MoE) Dynamic Routing &amp; Parameter Sparsity</div><div class="ndesc">Conditional computation architecture replacing dense feed-forward networks with sparse pools of specialized expert networks, routing each token dynamically to top-k experts to scale total parameters without increasing @@inference@@ FLOP costs.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">y = \sum_{i \in \text{TopK}} \text{Softmax}(\text{KeepTopK}(H \cdot W_g, k))_i E_i(x)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Mixture of Experts (MoE) &bull; Router (Gating Network)</div></div></div>
