<div class="ncard"><a id="node-supervised-classification" name="node-supervised-classification"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#101/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">supervised-classification</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:41</td><td class="yld vd">Y:52</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Supervised Classification: Logistic, SVM, Decision Trees &amp; Bayes</div><div class="ndesc">Fundamental algorithms mapping input feature vectors to discrete categorical labels: Logistic Regression, Support Vector Machines (SVM), Decision Trees (CART), K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN), and Naive Bayes.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\min_{w, b, \xi} \frac{1}{2} \|w\|^2 + C \sum_{i=1}^N \xi_i \quad \text{s.t.} \quad y_i(w^T \phi(x_i) + b) \ge 1 - \xi_i, \quad \xi_i \ge 0</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Kernel Trick &bull; Support Vectors</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-supervised-regression" name="node-supervised-regression"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#102/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">supervised-regression</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:41</td><td class="yld vd">Y:52</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Supervised Regression: Linear, Ridge, Lasso, Elastic Net &amp; SVR</div><div class="ndesc">Predicting continuous scalar values from multivariate features: Ordinary Least Squares (OLS), L2 Ridge regression, L1 Lasso feature selection, Elastic Net blends, and Support Vector Regression.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\mathcal{L}_{\text{Elastic}}(w) = \frac{1}{2n} \|y - X w\|_2^2 + \lambda \left( \alpha \|w\|_1 + \frac{1 - \alpha}{2} \|w\|_2^2 \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> L1 Regularization (Lasso) &bull; L2 Regularization (Ridge / Tikhonov)</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-unsupervised-clustering" name="node-unsupervised-clustering"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#103/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">unsupervised-clustering</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:61</td><td class="yld vd">Y:60</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Unsupervised Clustering: K-Means, DBSCAN, Hierarchical &amp; GMM</div><div class="ndesc">Partitioning unlabelled datasets into cohesive groups: centroid-based K-Means, agglomerative hierarchical dendrograms, density-based DBSCAN for arbitrary geometries, and Gaussian Mixture Models.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">J = \sum_{k=1}^K \sum_{x_i \in C_k} \|x_i - \mu_k\|^2</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> DBSCAN &bull; Silhouette Coefficient</div></div></div>
