<div class="ncard"><a id="node-reinforcement-learning" name="node-reinforcement-learning"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#107/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">reinforcement-learning</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Reinforcement Learning: Q-Learning, DQN, SARSA &amp; AlphaZero</div><div class="ndesc">Learning optimal decision sequences through trial-and-error reward signals in Markov Decision Processes (MDPs): model-free Q-learning, deep Q-networks (DQN), on-policy SARSA, and AlphaZero MCTS.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Q^*(s, a) = R(s, a) + \gamma \max_{a&#39; \in \mathcal{A}} Q^*(s&#39;, a&#39;)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Experience Replay &bull; SARSA</div></div></div>
