<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 06 &bull; Quantum Computing Mind Map</div>
<div class="sec-title">Quantum Computing &amp; Information Systems</div>
<div class="sec-desc">Quantum superposition, entanglement, Bloch sphere gates, QFT, Shor &amp; Grover speedups, Surface Code error correction, QKD protocols, and Variational Quantum Algorithms (VQE/QAOA).</div>
