<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 07 &bull; Must-Know System Performance Strategies &amp; vCAC Menu Map</div>
<div class="sec-title">System Performance Strategies &amp; Cloud Architecture</div>
<div class="sec-desc">High-performance distributed systems: CAP/PACELC theorems, consistent hashing, database sharding, caching strategies, async messaging, enterprise orchestration, neuromorphic computing, and chaos resilience.</div>
