<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 11 &bull; Gamification Economics, SaaS KPIs &amp; Behavioral Monetization Invariant Model</div>
<div class="sec-title">Behavioral Gamification, SaaS KPIs &amp; High-Profitability Monetization Economics</div>
<div class="sec-desc">Enterprise @@SaaS@@ unit economics (@@LTV@@:@@CAC@@, NRR, Payback), Marczewski user type targeting, Skinner variable ratio loops, Hooked @@retention@@ flywheels, the 12 business game mechanics, loss aversion streak lock-in, and high-ROAS revenue optimization.</div>
