<div class="ncard"><a id="node-poltech-quadratic-voting-sybil-resistant-identity" name="node-poltech-quadratic-voting-sybil-resistant-identity"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#943/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">poltech-quadratic-voting-sybil-resistant-identity</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:84</td><td class="yld vd">Y:70</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:12</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Decentralized Quadratic Voting &amp; Sybil-Resistant Identity Protocols</div><div class="ndesc">Computational collective decision-making platform allowing participants to express intensity of preference by buying votes where the marginal cost of voting scales quadratically with vote count.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\text{Cost}(v_i) = v_i^2, \quad \max_{\mathbf{v}} \sum_{i=1}^N \left( u_i v_i - v_i^2 \right) \implies v_i^* = \frac{u_i}{2}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Sybil Resistance &bull; Voice Credits</div></div></div>
