<td width="64%" class="vd">
<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 40 &bull; USA National Air Shield Integrated IAMDS Architecture &amp; MDTF Sensor Topology</div>
<div class="sec-title">USA National Air Shield: Strategic Integrated Air &amp; Missile Defense</div>
<div class="sec-desc">High-altitude long-range interceptor networks, Directed Energy Maneuver-Short Range Air Defense (DE M-SHORAD), Multi-Domain Task Force (MDTF) sensor integration, and 2026 economic trade models for interceptor production.</div>
</td>
