<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-iamds-integration" name="node-shield-iamds-integration"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1035/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-iamds-integration</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Integrated Air &amp; Missile Defense System (IAMDS) Nexus</div><div class="ndesc">The central nervous system for national air defense, integrating AESA radar feeds, satellite IRST, and terrestrial interceptor telemetry into a unified 5D kill-web.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{d, fused} = 1 - \prod_{i=1}^{N} (1 - P_{d,i} \cdot w_i \cdot \gamma_{SNR})</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Kill-Web &bull; AESA Radar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-hypersonic-interceptor" name="node-shield-hypersonic-interceptor"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1036/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-hypersonic-interceptor</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Next-Generation Hypersonic Interceptor (NGHI)</div><div class="ndesc">Counter-hypersonic missile system designed to engage maneuverable glide vehicles in the upper atmosphere using kinetic-kill technology and dual-mode seekers.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">K_e = \frac{1}{2} m \cdot (15 \cdot a)^2 + \Delta H_{chem}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Kinetic Kill &bull; HGV</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-directed-energy-mshorad" name="node-shield-directed-energy-mshorad"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1037/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-directed-energy-mshorad</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">DE M-SHORAD: Laser Maneuver Air Defense</div><div class="ndesc">Mobile 50kW-class high-energy laser weapon system integrated into Stryker platforms for neutralizing UAV swarms, RAM, and rotary-wing threats.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">t_{dwell} = \frac{\rho \cdot V \cdot C_p \cdot (T_{melt} - T_{amb})}{I \cdot A \cdot (1 - R)}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Dwell Time &bull; RAM</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-thaad-v2-stratosphere" name="node-shield-thaad-v2-stratosphere"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1038/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-thaad-v2-stratosphere</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">THAAD-V2: Stratospheric Defense Layer</div><div class="ndesc">Enhanced Terminal High Altitude Area Defense (THAAD) with extended-range boosters and advanced multi-spectral IR seekers for stratospheric interception.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">\nabla V_{cov} = \oint_{S} \mathbf{r}(\theta, \phi) \cdot d\mathbf{A} - \text{Shadow}_{terrain}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Endo-atmospheric &bull; Exo-atmospheric</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-aegis-shore-upgrade" name="node-shield-aegis-shore-upgrade"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1039/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-aegis-shore-upgrade</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Aegis Ashore Gen-4 Deployment</div><div class="ndesc">Terrestrial version of the SPY-6 radar and MK-41 VLS system, providing persistent ballistic and cruise missile defense for strategic homeland assets.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">S_{gain} = 10 \log_{10}(RMA_{count}) + G_{proc} - L_{atmos}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> VLS &bull; SM-3</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-ltamds-radar-node" name="node-shield-ltamds-radar-node"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1040/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-ltamds-radar-node</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">LTAMDS: Lower Tier Air &amp; Missile Defense Sensor</div><div class="ndesc">360-degree AESA radar designed to replace the legacy Patriot radar, optimized for counter-hypersonic and counter-UAS mission sets.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{track} = (1 - P_{handover}) \cdot \min(Duty_{main}, Duty_{side1}, Duty_{side2})</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> GaN &bull; LTAMDS</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-ibc-fire-control" name="node-shield-ibc-fire-control"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1041/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-ibc-fire-control</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">IBCS: Integrated Battle Command System</div><div class="ndesc">An open-architecture &#39;any sensor, best shooter&#39; network that allows Patriot, THAAD, and Sentinel radars to share a common tactical picture.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">\Delta T_{eng} = T_{legacy} - (T_{comm, async} + T_{opt, shooter})</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Open Architecture &bull; Common Tactical Picture</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-space-based-ir-sensor" name="node-shield-space-based-ir-sensor"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1042/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-space-based-ir-sensor</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">HBTSS: Hypersonic &amp; Ballistic Tracking Space Sensor</div><div class="ndesc">A constellation of Low Earth Orbit (LEO) satellites with high-sensitivity infrared sensors to track dim hypersonic threats from above.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">T_{revisit} = \frac{4 \pi \cdot R_{earth}^2}{N_{sat} \cdot A_{fov} \cdot V_{sat}}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> LEO &bull; IRST</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-gpi-glide-phase-interceptor" name="node-shield-gpi-glide-phase-interceptor"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1043/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-gpi-glide-phase-interceptor</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Glide Phase Interceptor (GPI) Counter-HGV Matrix</div><div class="ndesc">Naval and terrestrial mid-course interceptor engineered to destroy hypersonic boost-glide vehicles during their vulnerable unpowered skip-glide phase between 40km and 100km altitude.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">\Delta v_{divert} = \frac{N&#39; \cdot ZEM}{t_{go}} + \int_{0}^{t_{go}} a_{target}(\tau) \cdot e^{-\tau / \tau_{seeker}} d\tau</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Glide Phase &bull; DACS</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-hpm-swarm-neutralizer" name="node-shield-hpm-swarm-neutralizer"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1044/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-hpm-swarm-neutralizer</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">High-Power Microwave (HPM) Counter-Swarm Phased Array</div><div class="ndesc">Solid-state L-band and Ku-band high-power microwave array that projects intense electromagnetic pulses in a steered cone, frying the flight controllers of entire drone swarms simultaneously.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">E_{coupled} = \frac{\sqrt{30 \cdot P_{peak} \cdot G_{array}}}{R} \cdot \sqrt{A_{eff}} \cdot \eta_{rect}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Back-Door Coupling &bull; Magazine Depth</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-oth-b-ionospheric-radar" name="node-shield-oth-b-ionospheric-radar"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1045/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-oth-b-ionospheric-radar</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Next-Gen Over-The-Horizon Backscatter (OTH-B) Radar</div><div class="ndesc">High-frequency (HF) skywave radar array that refracts signals off the ionosphere to detect low-flying stealth cruise missiles and strategic bombers thousands of kilometers beyond the horizon.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">D_{ground} = 2 R_E \arccos\left(\frac{R_E \cos\Delta}{R_E + h_{virt}(f, N_e)}\right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Skywave &bull; Clutter Cancellation</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-pac3-mse-hit-to-kill" name="node-shield-pac3-mse-hit-to-kill"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1046/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-pac3-mse-hit-to-kill</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">PAC-3 MSE: Attitude Control Lethality Enhancer</div><div class="ndesc">Patriot Advanced Capability-3 Missile Segment Enhancement featuring a dual-pulse solid rocket motor, enlarged aerodynamic fins, and 180 miniature attitude control motors for extreme terminal agility.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">n_{max} = \frac{q_{dyn} \cdot S_{ref} \cdot C_{L,max} + F_{ACM}}{m_{terminal} \cdot g_0}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Hit-to-Kill &bull; Dual-Pulse Motor</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-indirect-fire-c-ram-dome" name="node-shield-indirect-fire-c-ram-dome"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1047/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-indirect-fire-c-ram-dome</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:53</td><td class="yld vd">Y:57</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Enduring Shield IFPC: Cruise Missile &amp; UAS Interceptor</div><div class="ndesc">Mobile ground-based launcher firing AIM-9X Block II and Tamir-derived interceptors to bridge the gap between short-range SHORAD and high-altitude Patriot batteries.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{pen} = \sum_{k=M+1}^{K} \binom{K}{k} P_{hit}^k (1 - P_{kill, single})^{m_{alloc}}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> IFPC &bull; Shoot-Look-Shoot</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-passive-coherent-locator" name="node-shield-passive-coherent-locator"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1048/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-passive-coherent-locator</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Silent Sentry: Multi-Static Passive Coherent Location (PCL)</div><div class="ndesc">Receive-only covert radar network that exploits ambient 5G cellular, DVB-T television, and Starlink broadcasts as illuminators of opportunity to track stealth aircraft without emitting RF energy.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">|\chi(\tau, f_d)|^2 = \left| \int_{-T/2}^{T/2} s_{surv}(t) \cdot s_{ref}^*(t - \tau) e^{-j 2\pi f_d t} dt \right|^2</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Bistatic Radar &bull; Illuminator of Opportunity</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-stratospheric-aerostat-irst" name="node-shield-stratospheric-aerostat-irst"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1049/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-stratospheric-aerostat-irst</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:53</td><td class="yld vd">Y:57</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">JLENS-Next: Stratospheric Persistent IRST Aerostat Tether</div><div class="ndesc">High-altitude autonomous airships and tethered aerostats operating at 65,000 feet with wide-area X-band radar and long-wave infrared (LWIR) optics to eliminate terrain masking.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">R_{horizon} = \sqrt{2 \cdot k_{refr} \cdot R_E \cdot h_{sensor}} + \sqrt{2 \cdot k_{refr} \cdot R_E \cdot h_{target}}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Terrain Masking &bull; LWIR</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-ngi-ekv-exo-interceptor" name="node-shield-ngi-ekv-exo-interceptor"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1050/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-ngi-ekv-exo-interceptor</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">NGI: Next-Generation Interceptor Multiple Kill Vehicle Bus</div><div class="ndesc">Silo-based intercontinental ballistic missile interceptor carrying multiple independent exo-atmospheric kill vehicles capable of discriminating real warheads from complex Mylar balloon decoys.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">D_{KL}(P_{RV} \parallel P_{decoy}) = \int_{\lambda_1}^{\lambda_2} P_{RV}(\lambda, T) \ln\left(\frac{P_{RV}(\lambda, T)}{P_{decoy}(\lambda, T</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Countermeasure Complex &bull; Mid-Course Phase</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-ai-wargaming-battle-manager" name="node-shield-ai-wargaming-battle-manager"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1051/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-ai-wargaming-battle-manager</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Reinforcement Learning Weapons-Target Assignment (WTA) Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Sub-millisecond combinatorial optimization engine that solves the NP-hard Weapons-Target Assignment problem across thousands of simultaneous tracks and heterogeneous interceptor batteries.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">\min_{x_{ij} \in \{0,1\}} \sum_{j=1}^{T} V_j \prod_{i=1}^{W} (1 - P_{kill, ij})^{x_{ij}} + \lambda \sum_{i=1}^{W} \sum_{j=1}^{T} C_i x_{ij}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> WTA &bull; Human-on-the-Loop</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-ew-gps-spoofing-dome" name="node-shield-ew-gps-spoofing-dome"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1052/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-ew-gps-spoofing-dome</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">NavWar Shield: Regional GNSS Denial &amp; Phase-Coherent Spoofing</div><div class="ndesc">Synchronized network of ground-based electronic warfare emitters that inject phase-coherent false GPS/GLONASS/BeiDou timing signals, steering incoming autonomous missiles into uninhabited terrain.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">\|\mathbf{z}_k - \mathbf{H}_k \hat{\mathbf{x}}_{k|k-1}\|_{S_k^{-1}}^2 &lt; \gamma_{chi2} \implies \Delta \mathbf{p}_{drift}(t) = \frac{1}{2} \m</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Meaconing &bull; RAIM</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-sm6-dual-ii-hypersonic-maritime" name="node-shield-sm6-dual-ii-hypersonic-maritime"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1053/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-sm6-dual-ii-hypersonic-maritime</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:76</td><td class="yld vd">Y:66</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">SM-6 Block IB: Sea-Based Terminal &amp; Glide Phase Shield</div><div class="ndesc">Upgraded Standard Missile-6 featuring a 21-inch rocket motor and active radar seeker, capable of intercepting maneuvering hypersonic threats in the terminal phase from offshore Aegis destroyers.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">V_{burnout} = I_{sp} \cdot g_0 \ln\left(\frac{m_0}{m_f}\right) - \int_{0}^{t_b} \left(\frac{D(M, h)}{m(t)} + g \sin\gamma\right) dt</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Engage-on-Remote &bull; Sea-Based Terminal</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-shield-quantum-clock-mesh-sync" name="node-shield-quantum-clock-mesh-sync"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1054/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">shield-quantum-clock-mesh-sync</td><td class="vd"></td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:96</td><td class="yld vd">Y:74</td><td class="vd">Eq:2|J:2</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Optical Atomic Clock Mesh for GPS-Denied Phase Coherence</div><div class="ndesc">Chip-scale optical lattice atomic clocks deployed across radar and interceptor nodes to maintain picosecond time synchronization for multistatic beamforming even if the entire GPS constellation is destroyed.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (2):</b> <span class="eqf">\sigma_y(\tau) = \frac{1}{\omega_0 \sqrt{N_{atoms} \cdot T_{probe} \cdot \tau}} \implies \Delta \phi_{beam} = 2\pi f_{RF} \cdot \tau \cdot \</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Allan Deviation &bull; Holdover Time</div></div></div>
