<td width="64%" class="vd">
<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 42 &bull; 6 Types of Ecommerce (B2C) &amp; 4-Pillar Operational Mechanics Blueprint</div>
<div class="sec-title">B2C: Business-to-Consumer Prompt Engineering &amp; Solo Automation</div>
<div class="sec-desc">B2C e-commerce model where a solo-operated automated business sells digital products, AI utilities, and consumer goods directly to individual online shoppers at massive scale via prompt-engineered funnels.</div>
</td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">NODES</div><div class="sec-val">48</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN C</div><div class="sec-val">63.1</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN Y</div><div class="sec-val">127</div></td>
</tr>
</table>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2c-manufacture-package" name="node-b2c-manufacture-package"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1127/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2c-manufacture-package</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:28</td><td class="yld vd">Y:101</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2C Package &amp; Digital Asset Bundling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2C@@ (Business-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that packages and wraps high-perceived-value product SKUs, dielines, and tiered digital-physical bundles. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using multi-modal dieline &amp; value-stack prompt synthesis with json schema validation and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve individual online shoppers seeking instant utility, entertainment, or lifestyle upgrades at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">M_{pkg} = \frac{\sum_{k=1}^{K} V_{perceived, k} \cdot (1 - \tau_{token})}{C_{BOM} + C_{pack, auto}} \ge \gamma_{target}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2C (Business-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2c-manufacture-raw-material" name="node-b2c-manufacture-raw-material"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1128/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2c-manufacture-raw-material</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:32</td><td class="yld vd">Y:109</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2C Raw Material &amp; Prompt Corpus Sourcing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2C@@ (Business-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that sources, sanitizes, and indexes upstream raw materials, supplier feeds, API tokens, and domain prompt corpora. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using source-ingestion extraction prompts with entity normalization and supplier reliability scoring and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve individual online shoppers seeking instant utility, entertainment, or lifestyle upgrades at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{raw}^* = \min_{s \in \mathcal{S}} \left( P_s \cdot Q + \lambda_{defect} \cdot (1 - \text{Purity}_s) + L_{lead, s} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2C (Business-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
