<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 43 &bull; 6 Types of Ecommerce (D2C) &amp; D2C Model 4-Pillar Operational Blueprint</div>
<div class="sec-title">D2C: Direct-to-Consumer Brand Automation &amp; Prompt Engineering</div>
<div class="sec-desc">D2C e-commerce model enabling solo-founder brands to manufacture, package, market, fulfill, and analyze their proprietary products directly to end customers without retail middlemen.</div>
</td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">NODES</div><div class="sec-val">48</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN C</div><div class="sec-val">63.1</div></td>
