<td width="64%" class="vd">
<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 44 &bull; 6 Types of Ecommerce (C2C) &amp; 4-Pillar Operational Mechanics Blueprint</div>
<div class="sec-title">C2C: Consumer-to-Consumer Marketplace Automation &amp; Prompt Engineering</div>
<div class="sec-desc">C2C digital platform architecture built and automated by a solo entrepreneur enabling individuals to list, price, verify, and sell their own physical or digital items directly to other consumers.</div>
</td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">NODES</div><div class="sec-val">48</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN C</div><div class="sec-val">63.1</div></td>
<td width="12%" class="tc"><div class="sec-kicker">MEAN Y</div><div class="sec-val">127</div></td>
</tr>
</table>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2c-manufacture-package" name="node-c2c-manufacture-package"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1223/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2c-manufacture-package</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:28</td><td class="yld vd">Y:101</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2C Package &amp; Digital Asset Bundling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2C@@ (Consumer-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that packages and wraps high-perceived-value product SKUs, dielines, and tiered digital-physical bundles. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using multi-modal dieline &amp; value-stack prompt synthesis with json schema validation and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve peer consumers purchasing verified pre-owned goods, niche collectibles, or digital templates from other individuals at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">M_{pkg} = \frac{\sum_{k=1}^{K} V_{perceived, k} \cdot (1 - \tau_{token})}{C_{BOM} + C_{pack, auto}} \ge \gamma_{target}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2c-manufacture-raw-material" name="node-c2c-manufacture-raw-material"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1224/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2c-manufacture-raw-material</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:32</td><td class="yld vd">Y:109</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2C Raw Material &amp; Prompt Corpus Sourcing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2C@@ (Consumer-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that sources, sanitizes, and indexes upstream raw materials, supplier feeds, API tokens, and domain prompt corpora. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using source-ingestion extraction prompts with entity normalization and supplier reliability scoring and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve peer consumers purchasing verified pre-owned goods, niche collectibles, or digital templates from other individuals at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{raw}^* = \min_{s \in \mathcal{S}} \left( P_s \cdot Q + \lambda_{defect} \cdot (1 - \text{Purity}_s) + L_{lead, s} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2c-manufacture-storage-of-goods" name="node-c2c-manufacture-storage-of-goods"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1225/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2c-manufacture-storage-of-goods</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:40</td><td class="yld vd">Y:124</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2C Storage of Goods &amp; Artifact Warehousing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2C@@ (Consumer-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that warehouses physical inventory buffers, pre-compiled digital goods, and content-addressable vector artifacts. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using inventory state-reconciliation prompts with semantic sku deduplication and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve peer consumers purchasing verified pre-owned goods, niche collectibles, or digital templates from other individuals at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Q_{EOQ}^* = \sqrt{\frac{2 D \cdot S_{setup}}{H_{hold} + C_{edge\_byte}}}, \quad C_{total} = \frac{D}{Q^*} S_{setup} + \frac{Q^*}{2} H_{hold}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2c-manufacture-production-planning" name="node-c2c-manufacture-production-planning"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1226/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2c-manufacture-production-planning</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:47</td><td class="yld vd">Y:139</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2C Production Planning &amp; Capacity Scheduling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2C@@ (Consumer-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that orchestrates production planning, sprint capacity allocation, and batch job scheduling via prompt-compiled DAGs. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using constraint-satisfaction planning prompts with critical-path topological sorting and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve peer consumers purchasing verified pre-owned goods, niche collectibles, or digital templates from other individuals at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">T_{makespan} = \max_{\pi \in \mathcal{P}_{DAG}} \sum_{v \in \pi} \left( \frac{W_v}{R_{alloc, v} \cdot \eta_{auto}} \right) + \Delta_{sync}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2c-manufacture-making" name="node-c2c-manufacture-making"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1227/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2c-manufacture-making</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:59</td><td class="yld vd">Y:163</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2C Making: Autonomous Product Synthesis Engine: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2C@@ (Consumer-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that executes core making and fabrication—transforming prompt specifications into finished software, media, or physical SKUs. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using dspy/mipro multi-stage synthesis pipelines with deterministic ast and cad grammar constraints and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve peer consumers purchasing verified pre-owned goods, niche collectibles, or digital templates from other individuals at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Y_{making} = \mu_{workers} \cdot \prod_{m=1}^{M} \left( 1 - P_{err, m}(\theta_{prompt}) \right) \cdot e^{-\lambda_{rework}}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
