<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2c-manufacture-qa-eval-gates" name="node-c2c-manufacture-qa-eval-gates"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1229/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2c-manufacture-qa-eval-gates</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:63</td><td class="yld vd">Y:171</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2C Quality Assurance &amp; LLM-as-a-Judge Eval Gates: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2C@@ (Consumer-to-Consumer) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that enforces automated quality control using LLM-as-a-Judge evaluation rubrics, semantic entropy probes, and regression gates. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using constitutional rubric evaluation prompts with calibrated elo pairwise scoring and deterministic assertions and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve peer consumers purchasing verified pre-owned goods, niche collectibles, or digital templates from other individuals at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{false\_pass} = \prod_{j=1}^{J} \left( 1 - \text{Sensitivity}_j(\tau_{rubric}) \right) \le 10^{-4}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
