<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-package" name="node-c2b-manufacture-package"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1271/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-package</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:28</td><td class="yld vd">Y:101</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Package &amp; Digital Asset Bundling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that packages and wraps high-perceived-value product SKUs, dielines, and tiered digital-physical bundles. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using multi-modal dieline &amp; value-stack prompt synthesis with json schema validation and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">M_{pkg} = \frac{\sum_{k=1}^{K} V_{perceived, k} \cdot (1 - \tau_{token})}{C_{BOM} + C_{pack, auto}} \ge \gamma_{target}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-raw-material" name="node-c2b-manufacture-raw-material"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1272/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-raw-material</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:32</td><td class="yld vd">Y:109</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Raw Material &amp; Prompt Corpus Sourcing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that sources, sanitizes, and indexes upstream raw materials, supplier feeds, API tokens, and domain prompt corpora. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using source-ingestion extraction prompts with entity normalization and supplier reliability scoring and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{raw}^* = \min_{s \in \mathcal{S}} \left( P_s \cdot Q + \lambda_{defect} \cdot (1 - \text{Purity}_s) + L_{lead, s} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-storage-of-goods" name="node-c2b-manufacture-storage-of-goods"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1273/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-storage-of-goods</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:40</td><td class="yld vd">Y:124</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Storage of Goods &amp; Artifact Warehousing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that warehouses physical inventory buffers, pre-compiled digital goods, and content-addressable vector artifacts. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using inventory state-reconciliation prompts with semantic sku deduplication and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Q_{EOQ}^* = \sqrt{\frac{2 D \cdot S_{setup}}{H_{hold} + C_{edge\_byte}}}, \quad C_{total} = \frac{D}{Q^*} S_{setup} + \frac{Q^*}{2} H_{hold}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-production-planning" name="node-c2b-manufacture-production-planning"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1274/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-production-planning</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:47</td><td class="yld vd">Y:139</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Production Planning &amp; Capacity Scheduling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that orchestrates production planning, sprint capacity allocation, and batch job scheduling via prompt-compiled DAGs. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using constraint-satisfaction planning prompts with critical-path topological sorting and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">T_{makespan} = \max_{\pi \in \mathcal{P}_{DAG}} \sum_{v \in \pi} \left( \frac{W_v}{R_{alloc, v} \cdot \eta_{auto}} \right) + \Delta_{sync}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-making" name="node-c2b-manufacture-making"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1275/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-making</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:59</td><td class="yld vd">Y:163</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Making: Autonomous Product Synthesis Engine: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that executes core making and fabrication—transforming prompt specifications into finished software, media, or physical SKUs. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using dspy/mipro multi-stage synthesis pipelines with deterministic ast and cad grammar constraints and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Y_{making} = \mu_{workers} \cdot \prod_{m=1}^{M} \left( 1 - P_{err, m}(\theta_{prompt}) \right) \cdot e^{-\lambda_{rework}}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-logistics" name="node-c2b-manufacture-logistics"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1276/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-logistics</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:51</td><td class="yld vd">Y:146</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Routing Automation: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that automates inbound/outbound logistics, 3PL carrier rate shopping, customs clearance, and global edge routing. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using multi-objective routing prompts for hs-code classification, customs documentation, and carrier sla selection and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\min_{x_{ij}} \sum_{(i,j) \in \mathcal{E}} \left( c_{ij} + \tau_{tariff, ij} \right) x_{ij} \quad \text{s.t.} \quad \sum_{e \in p} t_e \le T</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-qa-eval-gates" name="node-c2b-manufacture-qa-eval-gates"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1277/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-qa-eval-gates</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:63</td><td class="yld vd">Y:171</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Quality Assurance &amp; LLM-as-a-Judge Eval Gates: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that enforces automated quality control using LLM-as-a-Judge evaluation rubrics, semantic entropy probes, and regression gates. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using constitutional rubric evaluation prompts with calibrated elo pairwise scoring and deterministic assertions and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{false\_pass} = \prod_{j=1}^{J} \left( 1 - \text{Sensitivity}_j(\tau_{rubric}) \right) \le 10^{-4}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-manufacture-bom-cost-optimization" name="node-c2b-manufacture-bom-cost-optimization"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1278/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-manufacture-bom-cost-optimization</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:67</td><td class="yld vd">Y:179</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B BOM &amp; Token Inference Unit-Cost Compression: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that compresses Bill-of-Materials (BOM) and LLM token inference costs via prefix caching, quantization, and supplier teardown. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using radix-tree prefix-aligned system prompts engineered for 90%+ kv-cache hit rates and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{unit\_BOM} = C_{mat} + N_{tok} \left[ p_{cache} C_{cached} + (1 - p_{cache}) \left( \alpha_{small} C_{8B} + (1 - \alpha_{small}) C_{70B} </span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-attracting-content-marketing" name="node-c2b-attracting-content-marketing"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1279/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-attracting-content-marketing</td><td class="vd">Attracting Clients &amp; Acquisition</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:30</td><td class="yld vd">Y:105</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Content Marketing: Multi-Agent Authority Engine: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Attracting Clients** pillar that produces high-authority technical case studies, interactive calculators, and pillar content via multi-agent editorial pipelines. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using persona-calibrated chain-of-density copywriting prompts with real empirical data injection and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">L_{org}(t) = \sum_{i=1}^{N_{assets}(t)} V_{search, i} \cdot CTR_i \cdot CVR_{lead, i} \cdot e^{\lambda_{domain} t}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Attracting Clients Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-attracting-remarketing" name="node-c2b-attracting-remarketing"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1280/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-attracting-remarketing</td><td class="vd">Attracting Clients &amp; Acquisition</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:43</td><td class="yld vd">Y:131</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B Remarketing: Behavioral Intent &amp; Win-Back Flows: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Attracting Clients** pillar that recaptures bouncing visitors and abandoned carts through hyper-personalized multi-channel remarketing sequences. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using objection-diagnosis prompt synthesis tailored to exact page dwell history and cart contents and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">R_{recov} = \sum_{k=1}^{K_{touch}} A_{aband} \cdot p_{open, k} \cdot p_{conv \mid open, k} \cdot e^{-\beta \Delta t_k} - C_{msg, k}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Attracting Clients Pillar</div></div></div>
