<div class="ncard"><a id="node-c2b-attracting-pr-articles" name="node-c2b-attracting-pr-articles"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1284/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">c2b-attracting-pr-articles</td><td class="vd">Attracting Clients &amp; Acquisition</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:41</td><td class="yld vd">Y:127</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">C2B PR Articles: Automated Digital PR &amp; Earned Media Engine: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@C2B@@ (Consumer-to-Business) operational node within the **Attracting Clients** pillar that secures high-DR press placements, industry newsletter features, and podcast guest slots through data-driven PR article synthesis. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using newsjacking &amp; proprietary data-study pitch prompts matched to journalist beat embeddings and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve corporate marketing departments, ai training teams, and enterprise product managers licensing external creator ip at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\Delta CVR_{trust} = \alpha_{PR} \ln\left( 1 + \sum_{m=1}^{M_{press}} DR_m \cdot \text{Relevance}_m \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> C2B (Consumer-to-Business) &bull; Attracting Clients Pillar</div></div></div>
