<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 46 &bull; 6 Types of Ecommerce (B2G) &amp; 4-Pillar Operational Mechanics Blueprint</div>
<div class="sec-title">B2G: Business-to-Government Public-Sector Automation &amp; Prompt Engineering</div>
<div class="sec-desc">B2G e-commerce and public-sector contracting model where a solo-founder enterprise sells, automates, and delivers compliant software, data intelligence, and digital services to municipal, state, and federal government entities.</div>
</td>
<td width="12%" class="tc vd"><div class="sec-kicker">NODES</div><div class="sec-val">48</div></td>
