<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-package" name="node-b2g-manufacture-package"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1319/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-package</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:28</td><td class="yld vd">Y:111</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Package &amp; Digital Asset Bundling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that packages and wraps high-perceived-value product SKUs, dielines, and tiered digital-physical bundles. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using multi-modal dieline &amp; value-stack prompt synthesis with json schema validation and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">M_{pkg} = \frac{\sum_{k=1}^{K} V_{perceived, k} \cdot (1 - \tau_{token})}{C_{BOM} + C_{pack, auto}} \ge \gamma_{target}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-raw-material" name="node-b2g-manufacture-raw-material"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1320/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-raw-material</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Fundamental</td><td class="cmp vd">C:32</td><td class="yld vd">Y:119</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Raw Material &amp; Prompt Corpus Sourcing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that sources, sanitizes, and indexes upstream raw materials, supplier feeds, API tokens, and domain prompt corpora. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using source-ingestion extraction prompts with entity normalization and supplier reliability scoring and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{raw}^* = \min_{s \in \mathcal{S}} \left( P_s \cdot Q + \lambda_{defect} \cdot (1 - \text{Purity}_s) + L_{lead, s} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-storage-of-goods" name="node-b2g-manufacture-storage-of-goods"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1321/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-storage-of-goods</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:40</td><td class="yld vd">Y:134</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Storage of Goods &amp; Artifact Warehousing: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that warehouses physical inventory buffers, pre-compiled digital goods, and content-addressable vector artifacts. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using inventory state-reconciliation prompts with semantic sku deduplication and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Q_{EOQ}^* = \sqrt{\frac{2 D \cdot S_{setup}}{H_{hold} + C_{edge\_byte}}}, \quad C_{total} = \frac{D}{Q^*} S_{setup} + \frac{Q^*}{2} H_{hold}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-production-planning" name="node-b2g-manufacture-production-planning"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1322/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-production-planning</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:47</td><td class="yld vd">Y:149</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Production Planning &amp; Capacity Scheduling: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that orchestrates production planning, sprint capacity allocation, and batch job scheduling via prompt-compiled DAGs. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using constraint-satisfaction planning prompts with critical-path topological sorting and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">T_{makespan} = \max_{\pi \in \mathcal{P}_{DAG}} \sum_{v \in \pi} \left( \frac{W_v}{R_{alloc, v} \cdot \eta_{auto}} \right) + \Delta_{sync}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-making" name="node-b2g-manufacture-making"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1323/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-making</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:59</td><td class="yld vd">Y:173</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Making: Autonomous Product Synthesis Engine: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that executes core making and fabrication—transforming prompt specifications into finished software, media, or physical SKUs. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using dspy/mipro multi-stage synthesis pipelines with deterministic ast and cad grammar constraints and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">Y_{making} = \mu_{workers} \cdot \prod_{m=1}^{M} \left( 1 - P_{err, m}(\theta_{prompt}) \right) \cdot e^{-\lambda_{rework}}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-logistics" name="node-b2g-manufacture-logistics"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1324/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-logistics</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Intermediate</td><td class="cmp vd">C:51</td><td class="yld vd">Y:156</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Routing Automation: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that automates inbound/outbound logistics, 3PL carrier rate shopping, customs clearance, and global edge routing. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using multi-objective routing prompts for hs-code classification, customs documentation, and carrier sla selection and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\min_{x_{ij}} \sum_{(i,j) \in \mathcal{E}} \left( c_{ij} + \tau_{tariff, ij} \right) x_{ij} \quad \text{s.t.} \quad \sum_{e \in p} t_e \le T</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-qa-eval-gates" name="node-b2g-manufacture-qa-eval-gates"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1325/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-qa-eval-gates</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:63</td><td class="yld vd">Y:181</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G Quality Assurance &amp; LLM-as-a-Judge Eval Gates: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that enforces automated quality control using LLM-as-a-Judge evaluation rubrics, semantic entropy probes, and regression gates. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using constitutional rubric evaluation prompts with calibrated elo pairwise scoring and deterministic assertions and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{false\_pass} = \prod_{j=1}^{J} \left( 1 - \text{Sensitivity}_j(\tau_{rubric}) \right) \le 10^{-4}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-b2g-manufacture-bom-cost-optimization" name="node-b2g-manufacture-bom-cost-optimization"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1326/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">b2g-manufacture-bom-cost-optimization</td><td class="vd">Manufacture &amp; Production Automation</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:67</td><td class="yld vd">Y:189</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:8</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">B2G BOM &amp; Token Inference Unit-Cost Compression: Solo Prompt &amp; Automation Engine</div><div class="ndesc">Autonomous @@B2G@@ (Business-to-Government) operational node within the **Manufacture** pillar that compresses Bill-of-Materials (BOM) and LLM token inference costs via prefix caching, quantization, and supplier teardown. Engineered for solo entrepreneurs using radix-tree prefix-aligned system prompts engineered for 90%+ kv-cache hit rates and @@deterministic@@ webhook automation to serve municipal agencies, state cio offices, federal contracting officers, and defense sbir/micro-purchase buyers at 90%+ gross margin.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{unit\_BOM} = C_{mat} + N_{tok} \left[ p_{cache} C_{cached} + (1 - p_{cache}) \left( \alpha_{small} C_{8B} + (1 - \alpha_{small}) C_{70B} </span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> B2G (Business-to-Government) &bull; Manufacture Pillar</div></div></div>
