<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-hs-tariff-classification-06" name="node-goop-hs-tariff-classification-06"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1542/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-hs-tariff-classification-06</td><td class="vd">Statutory Customs Optimization</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:93</td><td class="yld vd">Y:91</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Harmonized System (HS) 10-Digit Tariff Engineering &amp; First-Sale Rule Valuation</div><div class="ndesc">Applies lawful customs tariff engineering and the &quot;First Sale for Export&quot; valuation doctrine (19 CFR 152.103), declaring customs duty on the factory-to-middleman manufacturing invoice price rather than the final retail consumer price.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">D_{duty} = \tau_{HS10}(\mathbf{f}_{spec}) \cdot V_{\text{FirstSale}}, \quad V_{\text{FirstSale}} = V_{factory \to tier1} \approx 0.35 \cdot </span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> First-Sale Customs Valuation &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-consolidation-qc-wald-sampling-07" name="node-goop-consolidation-qc-wald-sampling-07"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1543/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-consolidation-qc-wald-sampling-07</td><td class="vd">Pre-Shipment Quality Assurance</td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:97</td><td class="yld vd">Y:94</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Forwarder Warehouse Optical QC Inspection &amp; Pre-Export Defect Rejection Gate</div><div class="ndesc">Inserts a $1.50 high-resolution macroscopic photo, weight-gram verification, and electrical/dimensional check at the origin consolidation warehouse (Shenzhen/Osaka/Frankfurt) before paying international air freight, where return shipping is $0.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\Delta \text{EV}_{QC} = p_{defect} \cdot \left( F_{\text{intl\_out}} + F_{\text{intl\_return}} + D_{\text{sunk}} \right) - c_{QC} \gg 0</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Origin-Hub Gram-Scale Verification &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-cashback-stack-combinatorics-08" name="node-goop-cashback-stack-combinatorics-08"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1544/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-cashback-stack-combinatorics-08</td><td class="vd">Multiplicative Checkout Yield Calculus</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:83</td><td class="yld vd">Y:97</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Multi-Layer Rebate Stacking: Shopping Portal + Discounted Gift/FX Rail + Card Multiplier</div><div class="ndesc">Chains orthogonal rebate layers on a single global purchase: tracked affiliate cashback portal (Rakuten/TopCashback 8%–15%), card-linked merchant offer (Amex/Chase Offer), category points multiplier (4x–5x valued at 1.8 cpp), and discounted tax-free currency funding.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{net} = P_{gross} \cdot (1 - r_{coupon}) \cdot \left( 1 - r_{portal} - r_{card\_offer} - m_{pts} v_{cpp} \right)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Four-Layer Settlement Stack &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-anti-price-discrimination-fingerprint-09" name="node-goop-anti-price-discrimination-fingerprint-09"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1545/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-anti-price-discrimination-fingerprint-09</td><td class="vd">Algorithmic Pricing Counter-Measures</td><td class="vd">Expert</td><td class="cmp vd">C:87</td><td class="yld vd">Y:88</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Defeating Dynamic Geo/Device Price Discrimination via Clean-Container Parity Checking</div><div class="ndesc">Neutralizes airline, hotel, and global e-commerce personalized price inflation (triggered by high-income zip-code IPs, macOS/iOS User-Agent headers, and repeat cookie visits) by querying point-of-sale regional locales inside clean ephemeral browser containers.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">P_{quoted}(\mathbf{u}_{profile}, l_{POS}) = P_{base}(l_{POS}) + \Delta P_{\text{WTP}}(\text{OS}, \text{IP}_{zip}, N_{visits}), \quad P^* = \</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Point-of-Sale (POS) Locale Arbitrage &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-chargeback-escrow-game-10" name="node-goop-chargeback-escrow-game-10"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1546/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-chargeback-escrow-game-10</td><td class="vd">Consumer Risk-Reversal Mechanics</td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:91</td><td class="yld vd">Y:91</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Asymmetric Credit-Card Chargeback &amp; Purchase-Protection Insurance Game Matrix</div><div class="ndesc">Routes cross-border purchases exclusively through payment rails carrying statutory Fair Credit Billing Act (FCRA) chargeback rights and complimentary 90-day damage/theft/return-protection underwriting, shifting 100% of fulfillment risk onto the acquirer bank.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">L_{buyer}^{\text{max}} = \mathbb{I}(\text{Rail} = \text{Wire/Crypto}) \cdot P_{tx} + \mathbb{I}(\text{Rail} = \text{Tier1Credit}) \cdot 0 = </span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Regulation Z Escrow Asymmetry &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-air-vs-sea-pareto-frontier-11" name="node-goop-air-vs-sea-pareto-frontier-11"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1547/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-air-vs-sea-pareto-frontier-11</td><td class="vd">Multi-Modal Freight Economics</td><td class="vd">Expert</td><td class="cmp vd">C:87</td><td class="yld vd">Y:94</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Air-Express vs. DDP Sea-Freight Lead-Time-to-Holding-Cost Pareto Frontier</div><div class="ndesc">Computes the exact crossover density rho_crit (kg/m^3) and urgency discount rate where Delivered-Duty-Paid (DDP) ocean/rail consolidation ($1.80/kg) strictly dominates DHL/FedEx air express ($9.50/kg).</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\left( c_{\text{air}} - c_{\text{sea\_DDP}} \right) W_{charge} &gt; V_{item} \left( e^{r_{\text{wait}}(T_{sea} - T_{air})} - 1 \right) \implies</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> DDP Fast-Boat Consolidation &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-mean-reversion-optimal-stopping-12" name="node-goop-mean-reversion-optimal-stopping-12"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1548/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-mean-reversion-optimal-stopping-12</td><td class="vd">Dynamic Price-History Analytics</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:91</td><td class="yld vd">Y:97</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Ornstein-Uhlenbeck E-Commerce Price Cycling &amp; Optimal-Stopping Purchase Trigger</div><div class="ndesc">Models retail algorithmic pricing (Amazon/global outlets) as a periodic saw-tooth Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process and sets automated webhook limit orders at the 5th-percentile historical floor.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">\tau_{buy} = \inf\left\{ t \ge 0 : P_t \le Q_{0.05}\left(\{P_s\}_{s=t-365}^t\right) \right\}, \quad \mathbb{E}[\tau_{buy}] \le T_{horizon}</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Retail Limit-Order Sniping &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-bayesian-vendor-reliability-13" name="node-goop-bayesian-vendor-reliability-13"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1549/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-bayesian-vendor-reliability-13</td><td class="vd">Adversarial Marketplace Vetting</td><td class="vd">Frontier</td><td class="cmp vd">C:95</td><td class="yld vd">Y:88</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Empirical-Bayes Beta-Binomial Seller Rating Shrinkage &amp; Fake-Review KL Filter</div><div class="ndesc">Applies Laplace/Beta-Binomial shrinkage to vendor ratings (preventing a 5-review 100% sockpuppet store from outranking a 4,000-review 98.5% factory) combined with review-timestamp Hawkes burst detection to prune astroturfed listings.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">S_{vendor} = \frac{\hat{p} + \frac{z_{\alpha/2}^2}{2n} - z_{\alpha/2}\sqrt{\frac{\hat{p}(1-\hat{p}) + z_{\alpha/2}^2/(4n)}{n}}}{1 + z_{\alph</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Wilson Lower-Bound Ranking &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
<div class="ncard"><a id="node-goop-customs-self-clearance-brokerage-14" name="node-goop-customs-self-clearance-brokerage-14"></a><table class="nbar" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="vd"><b>#1550/1592</b></td><td class="tm vd">goop-customs-self-clearance-brokerage-14</td><td class="vd">Last-Mile Brokerage Arbitrage</td><td class="vd">Advanced</td><td class="cmp vd">C:91</td><td class="yld vd">Y:91</td><td class="vd">Eq:4|J:4</td><td class="tr"><a href="#toc-top" class="lnk">TOC</a></td></tr></table><div class="nbody"><div class="ntitle">Automated Self-Clearance Customs Manifesting &amp; Courier Disbursement-Fee Bypass</div><div class="ndesc">Eliminates the flat $15–$45 &quot;Advancement/Disbursement Brokerage Fee&quot; charged by express couriers on dutiable parcels by electronically filing self-accounting customs entries directly with the national customs portal prior to aircraft touchdown.</div><div class="nnotes"><b>Eq (4):</b> <span class="eqf">C_{import} = D_{statutory} + F_{broker} \cdot (1 - \mathbb{I}_{\text{SelfClear}}), \quad \mathbb{I}_{\text{SelfClear}} = 1 \implies F_{broke</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Lexicon:</b> Pre-Arrival Self-Accounting Entry &bull; OmniSingularity Invariant</div></div></div>
