<div class="sec-desc">Thaler-Sunstein environmental choice architecture, coupled dyadic resistance-training Markov adherence, Rusbult Commitment-Model (C = S - A + I) fidelity maximization, shared circadian Zeitgeber alignment, and zero-coercion intrinsic motivation.</div>
