<td width="64%" class="vd">
<div class="sec-kicker">CATEGORY 61 &bull; TrueSkill2 Dyadic Flow-State Manifold &amp; Co-Op Synergy Pareto Frontier (Diagram OS-15)</div>
<div class="sec-title">Gamer Girl Sourcing by Apex Gamer for High-Yield Mutual Pleasure &amp; Co-Op Flow-State Synergy</div>
<div class="sec-desc">High-MMR TrueSkill2/Glicko-2 co-op discovery topology, complementary IGL/Support role-archetype supermodularity, Csikszentmihalyi dyadic flow-state locking, zero-tilt prosodic voice-comms compatibility, and mutual recreational/relational Pareto yield.</div>
